{"title":"2005 iTest Problems/Problem 25","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_iTest_Problems/Problem_25&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Consider the set <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/e/c/4ecb38d22cc7399815eed3c9f445286f828a5b29.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\{1!, 2!, 3!, 4!, …, 2004!, 2005!\\}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"231\" height=\"20\" />. How many elements of this set are divisible by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/f/5/9f5b442c275b4324f100c365b774e872b6b21f1e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2005$\" width=\"35\" height=\"12\" />?\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_iTest_Problems/Problem_25&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If for any <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/9/fc97ef67268cd4e91bacdf12b8901d7036c9a056.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$N$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/7/0/0700a3616c5f1597f275b4cd39e9072cd25660be.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$N!$\" width=\"20\" height=\"13\" /> is divisible by 2005, any integers greater than <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/9/fc97ef67268cd4e91bacdf12b8901d7036c9a056.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$N$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"14\" /> also share that property. So we should start by finding the smallest factorial that is divisible by 2005. Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/0/5/a050847917e5fd18a97af328b182af44019ae47a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2005=5\\cdot401$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"112\" height=\"14\" />, and 401 is prime, the smallest such <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/9/fc97ef67268cd4e91bacdf12b8901d7036c9a056.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$N$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"14\" /> is 401, as no smaller factorials are divisible by 401. Thus there are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/8/e/f8e0c9bf871c8aff68927204023b9dc3db63dc7b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$401-1=400$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"112\" height=\"15\" /> factorials that are not divisible by 2005, and our answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/b/09b5748b558655e1cd7709f20b96f1ed91b8c17e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2005-400=\\boxed{1605}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"160\" height=\"25\" /> such elements.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_iTest_Problems/Problem_25&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"clear:both; margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_iTest\" title=\"2005 iTest\">2005 iTest</a> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_iTest_Problems\" title=\"2005 iTest Problems\">(Problems</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_iTest_Answer_Key&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2005 iTest Answer Key (page does not exist)\">Answer Key)</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by:<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_iTest_Problems/Problem_24&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2005 iTest Problems/Problem 24 (page does not exist)\">Problem 24</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by:<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_iTest_Problems/Problem_26\" title=\"2005 iTest Problems/Problem 26\">Problem 26</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_iTest_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2005 iTest Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_iTest_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2005 iTest Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_iTest_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2005 iTest Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_iTest_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2005 iTest Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_iTest_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2005 iTest Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_iTest_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2005 iTest Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_iTest_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"2005 iTest Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_iTest_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"2005 iTest Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_iTest_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"2005 iTest Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_iTest_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"2005 iTest Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_iTest_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"2005 iTest Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_iTest_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"2005 iTest Problems/Problem 12\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_iTest_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"2005 iTest Problems/Problem 13\">13</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_iTest_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"2005 iTest Problems/Problem